From: Will Wright <wwright@microsoft.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Skip submodule update for pinned openvmm-deps build

openvmm-deps supplies TF-RMM submodules as explicit, pinned Docker inputs.
Do not let CMake fetch submodules from the network during configure.

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -23,9 +23,8 @@ include(ArmConfigOption)
 include(ArmConfigOptionOverride)
 
 #
-# Update the Submodules
+# Submodules are supplied by openvmm-deps as pinned Docker inputs.
 #
-Git_Update_Submodule()
 
 #
 # Run preliminary setup scripts.
